flowchart LR
    client[Cliente HTTP / Postman]
    consumer[Consumidor HTTP\nHTTPX + reintentos]

    subgraph docker[Docker Compose]
        subgraph backend[Backend FastAPI]
            middleware[Middleware HTTP\nRequest ID + logs\nrate limit + cola + GZip + caché]
            api[API v1\nRutas + Pydantic]
            service[Servicio de dominio\nReglas de negocio]
            repository[Repositorio\nSQLAlchemy async]

            middleware --> api
            api --> service
            service --> repository
        end

        redis[(Redis 7\nCaché GET con TTL)]
        postgres[(PostgreSQL 16\nFuente de verdad)]
        alembic[Alembic\nMigraciones + seed]
        logs[(Volumen de logs)]

        middleware <-->|GET/SET + versión| redis
        repository <-->|SQL async| postgres
        alembic -->|upgrade head| postgres
        middleware -->|logs estructurados| logs
    end

    client -->|HTTP / JSON| middleware
    consumer -->|POST + GET / JSON| middleware
